{"server":"tw","storyId":"act12side_level_act12side_06_beg","groupId":"act12side","stageId":"act12side_06","title":"緊追猛趕","storyCode":"DH-6","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"ed109bad60d4c23b3a478c0e1ac495bc95387562900c665f210737e1b250eb8a","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"陳林二人再次出現在大螢幕上，然而此時她們已經落後領先部隊太多，她們趕得上嗎？","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"水月選手在放棄了阻攔伏兵後，來到將陳林兩位選手掩埋的武器店廢墟之上，停留了一會兒後便不知所蹤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"我們所有的攝影機和無人機都沒有找到他的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"而第一梯隊中，甜蜜夏日隊，已經最先抵達游泳檢查點。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"第一梯隊的其他隊伍也陸續穿過了游泳檢查點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"而我們最關心的鼠膽龍威隊中，埃內斯托小弟為了殿後已經被打倒，我們的工作人員判斷他已經失去戰鬥能力了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"陳林兩位女俠此時卻依然沒有動靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"難道真的萬事休矣了嗎？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老陳，你不是吧，你不會倒在這種地方的對吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_190_1","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊小姐對比賽很在意呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪裡，她絕對是給陳押了大注，才在那念叨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"認識這麼久了，這種比賽的輸贏，誰在乎啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"輸了又不代表就怎麼了，贏了也不能證明什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒是希望她輸了，這樣我才好嘲笑她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，艾雅法拉，來，我來給你試試這款面霜，我覺得一定適合你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_190_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，謝謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"突然，又一聲轟鳴，從停留在埃內斯托武器店的鏡頭螢幕中傳來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，這難道是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G02"},{"type":"narration","text":"螢幕中，硝煙散去，而從硝煙中走出來的，正是推著自行車的陳和林雨霞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"來了來了，終於來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"陳女俠與林女俠又一次地站上了比賽的舞台！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，兩人只剩下一輛車，位置距離游泳檢查點還有一小段距離，而此時第一梯隊已經開始了游泳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"鼠膽龍威真的還有機會嗎？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G03"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你先走，我用跑的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上車。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別讓我再說一次，上車。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你確定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來騎，你來解決礙事的傢伙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"太令人感動了，雖然只剩下一輛車，但是林女俠並沒有拋棄陳女俠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"她讓陳女俠站上自己的車後座，由她來騎車，而陳女俠負責對付那些想要妨礙她們的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"兩個人，一輛自行車，一次讓所有人都目瞪口呆的完美配合！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"現在我敢說，她們兩個的組合，是這場大獎賽中最強大的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G03"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你壓到我頭髮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敵人在前面，我也沒辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能不能不要亂扭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不然你來騎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"陳忽地壓下林雨霞的頭，躲開了迎面而來的一個輪胎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"林雨霞卻猛地抬頭，狠狠撞在陳的臉上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"林雨霞，你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"意外。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"鼠膽龍威隊，飛快地突破了最後一段跑道，進入了沙灘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"游泳檢查點就在她們的眼前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，其他隊伍顯然不會那麼輕易地讓她們通過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"一場沙灘上的惡戰，即將爆發！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
